  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Capability and Training 2016/17</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natural disasters and humanitarian crises within our region are high profile and responding effectively to these crises is a key priority for Australia. This investment provides funding to support humanitarian capability training for Australia&apos;s humanitarian response practitioners in-country. The training will strengthen capacity to prepare for and respond to humanitarian crises. The total value of this investment is $0.4 million expensed in the 2016-17 financial year.</narrative>
  </description>
